  fishName: Deepdweller
  description: Dwelling on the mysterious solid core of Nimbus, noone is quite sure
    what the deep dweller actually looks like, as the incredible stresses placed
    on its body during the long journey into orbit has caused immense malformation.\n\n 
    Chef's Notes:\nAre you sure there's no way to catch one of these things without
    manglin' it like that? Like this, we have to mash it up and reconstitute it just
    to get a decent cut of meat...
